    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506940/extras/7d9a929169679a9883bf817e60418819.avif?t=1730949203\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Muffin Fight</strong> is a high-energy, arena-style VR game where baking meets battling! Compete in <strong>4-player multiplayer</strong>, test your skills in <strong>single-player mode</strong>, or take on <strong>bots</strong> in this deliciously chaotic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather your friends or challenge strangers in the ultimate food fight!</i> In just three minutes, you\u2019ll collect ingredients, whip up creative muffin recipes, and throw your treats at opponents in the chef-pit. Use strategic tools like garbage lids to block attacks or vacuum guns to steal items, and become the last player standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it\u2019s not all about the battles\u2014step into the social space to hang out with friends, set your name, and check your high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506940/extras/a73ccb27a3e685960643d09b94f70f80.avif?t=1730949203\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Action:</strong> Engage in thrilling matches with friends or players from around the world (2 to 4 players ideally).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player &amp; Bot Modes:</strong> Practice your skills against AI opponents or practice in single player challenge mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Space:</strong> Relax and connect with others, track your progress, and show off your achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to bake, battle, and have a blast in <i>Muffin Fight!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506940/extras/7d9a929169679a9883bf817e60418819.avif?t=1730949203\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Muffin Fight</strong> is a high-energy, arena-style VR game where baking meets battling! Compete in <strong>4-player multiplayer</strong>, test your skills in <strong>single-player mode</strong>, or take on <strong>bots</strong> in this deliciously chaotic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather your friends or challenge strangers in the ultimate food fight!</i> In just three minutes, you\u2019ll collect ingredients, whip up creative muffin recipes, and throw your treats at opponents in the chef-pit. Use strategic tools like garbage lids to block attacks or vacuum guns to steal items, and become the last player standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it\u2019s not all about the battles\u2014step into the social space to hang out with friends, set your name, and check your high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506940/extras/a73ccb27a3e685960643d09b94f70f80.avif?t=1730949203\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Action:</strong> Engage in thrilling matches with friends or players from around the world (2 to 4 players ideally).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player &amp; Bot Modes:</strong> Practice your skills against AI opponents or practice in single player challenge mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Space:</strong> Relax and connect with others, track your progress, and show off your achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to bake, battle, and have a blast in <i>Muffin Fight!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "The ultimate food fight \u2013 no cleanup required! Muffin Fight is a 4-player VR party game where you bake, throw, and battle! Challenge friends or foes in this multiplayer showdown. With wild ingredients and quick rounds, it\u2019s a fight to be the last player standing!",
